					"text": {
						"type": "string",
						"value": "FRACTAL NOISE\n\nThe Fractal Noise node creates a fractal noise texture based on different algorithms.\n\nFractal noise generates a noise pattern that can resemble things like clouds, water or a topographic map of a mountain range and iss often used in video games and movies to generate convincing height maps for mountains."
